n us into children once again, if only for a little while.","tagline":"This chick is clucking awesome!!!"},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Turuleca es una gallina singular. Su peculiar aspecto desata las burlas del resto del gallinero, hasta que un día Isabel, una ex-profesora de música, la lleva a vivir a su granja. Allí, feliz y en armonía, la gallina descubre su gran talento oculto con la ayuda de Isabel: ¡Turuleca no sólo puede hablar, sino que canta como jamás has oído cantar a una gallina!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yy0jQpW3mb30WI1KkB1oCl7mG8f.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tyKtvW3bTv8qTL5eIN8iY8VZBcD.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":653247,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yy0jQpW3mb30WI1KkB1oCl7mG8f.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yy0jQpW3mb30WI1KkB1oCl7mG8f.jpg","language":"it","width":1175,"height":1763},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yy0jQpW3mb30WI1KkB1oCl7mG8f.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yy0jQpW3mb30WI1KkB1oCl7mG8f.jpg","language":"it","width":1175,"height":1763}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xaG10x1C8dCHkNumSslH6jwzvpt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xaG10x1C8dCHkNumSslH6jwzvpt.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xaG10x1C8dCHkNumSslH6jwzvpt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xaG10x1C8dCHkNumSslH6jwzvpt.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oJ8Ly3IVxwV4n5fvSMbKZekBxal.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oJ8Ly3IVxwV4n5fvSM